# grows the same way; the comment names the nodes and warns about the world
# box; nodes= scopes it and a name nothing carries is omitted with a reason; a
# node with no thickness and no clearance is omitted rather than written flat;
# a reference over the cap is an error asking for nodes=).
# Plus 4 the clearance reply's LEAN DEFAULT (a caller that asks for nothing
# gets the nine rows that failed and not the forty-one that cleared, inside
# 3 KB instead of forty; what did not travel is COUNTED — pairs_passing,
# pairs_failing and pairs_hidden add up and the verdict is still graded over
# every pair; a row that travels keeps BOTH point frames; and failing_only
# with limit is honoured on the parts= leg too, which is where the rev-4
# session got fifty rows back). The "fixture: fifty pairs really is
# kilobytes" assertion now asks for detail="full" — that is the deliberate
# re-pin of the default reply shape.
# Plus 4 the screw LIST (an unscoped M3's window really does reach the stick's
# 2.6 mm holes, which is the noise the list removes; two sizes in one call
